### 🍊 Orchard — manual endpoint tests (VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP)
### Point @port at whichever target is running:
###   elysia 3001 · h3 3002 · hono 3003 · nitro-h3 3004 · nitro-hono 3005 · nitro-elysia 3006

@port = 3001
@host = http://localhost:{{port}}
@key = let-me-in-please

### Liveness
GET {{host}}/health

### List — filter + sort + cursor pagination
GET {{host}}/fruits?sort=price&limit=2

### List — next page (paste a nextCursor from the previous response)
GET {{host}}/fruits?sort=price&limit=2&cursor=orange

### List — filter by tag and ripeness
GET {{host}}/fruits?tag=vitamin-c&minRipeness=50

### Read one
GET {{host}}/fruits/apple

### Read one — 404
GET {{host}}/fruits/dragonfruit

### Create — 401 (no key)
POST {{host}}/fruits
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mango", "emoji": "🥭", "color": "orange", "tags": ["sweet"], "pricePerKg": 5, "stockKg": 12 }

### Create — 201
POST {{host}}/fruits
Content-Type: application/json
x-orchard-key: {{key}}

{ "name": "Mango", "emoji": "🥭", "color": "orange", "tags": ["sweet", "tropical"], "pricePerKg": 5, "stockKg": 12 }

### Create — 422 (validation)
POST {{host}}/fruits
Content-Type: application/json
x-orchard-key: {{key}}

{ "name": "" }

### Update — ripen the mango
PATCH {{host}}/fruits/mango
Content-Type: application/json
x-orchard-key: {{key}}

{ "ripeness": 95 }

### Checkout — 200
POST {{host}}/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [{ "id": "kiwi", "kg": 2 }, { "id": "apple", "kg": 1 }] }

### Checkout — 409 (out of stock)
POST {{host}}/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [{ "id": "kiwi", "kg": 9999 }] }

### Server-Sent Events — watch a fruit ripen
GET {{host}}/fruits/banana/ripen
Accept: text/event-stream

### Delete — 204
DELETE {{host}}/fruits/mango
x-orchard-key: {{key}}
